'''Visa requirements for Northern Cypriot citizens''' are administrative entry restrictions by the authorities of other states placed on citizens of [[Northern Cyprus]].

==Visa requirements==
Holders of an ordinary Northern Cypriot passport can visit one country ([[Visa policy of Turkey|Turkey]]) without the need to obtain an entry visa. The passport is accepted as a travel document by only three countries because [[Northern Cyprus]] has limited international recognition.{{citation needed|date=July 2025}} Usually, no visa is placed in the document.
